meta {
  name: Live
  seq: 4
}

docs {
  Paid checks against the real OpenAI (and Tavily) APIs. They run only with the LocalLive
  environment and are skipped in collection runs with any other environment, so the default
  `bru run --env Local` is free and deterministic.

  The model decides what to answer and whether to search, so these requests check only what
  the service itself guarantees (contract fields, limits, source rules), never the wording.
}
